 （12:00 - 13:10）。\n\n公告原文：\n2025-2026 Yearbook Pick-Up\n202
 5-2026 Yearbooks (from last year) will be availble for pick up on Tuesday\
 , September 29 in front of the Office during period 5 (12:00 pm - 1:10 pm)
